---
// src/components/ExperienceSection.astro
// Concrete timeline of achievements, internships, and production deployments
---

<section id="experience" class="section-padding experience-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal-on-scroll">
      <span class="section-tag">
        <span class="lang-id">Pengalaman & Prestasi</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Experience & Milestones</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        <span class="lang-id">Rekam Jejak Teknis & Profesional</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Technical & Professional Track Record</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        <span class="lang-id">
          Rekam jejak kompetisi LKS, implementasi sistem skala nyata, dan 3 Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PKL): administrasi server di BLK Kebumen, instalasi FTTH di Fazza Computer, dan pemeliharaan hardware di IMC Computer.
        </span>
        <span class="lang-en">
          A verifiable record of LKS competition, production system implementations, and 3 vocational internships (PKL): server administration at BLK Kebumen, FTTH deployment at Fazza Computer, and hardware maintenance at IMC Computer.
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline-container">
      <!-- Item 1: LKS 2026 -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
          <div class="timeline-dot gold"></div>
          <div class="timeline-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-card timeline-card highlight-border">
          <div class="timeline-card-header">
            <div>
              <span class="timeline-period font-mono">2026</span>
              <h3 class="timeline-role">
                <span class="lang-id">Juara 1 LKS IT Network System Administration Purworejo</span>
                <span class="lang-en">1st Place LKS IT Network System Administration Purworejo</span>
              </h3>
              <span class="timeline-org">LKS SMK Kabupaten Purworejo & Dinas Pendidikan Jawa Tengah</span>
            </div>
            <span class="award-pill">
              <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"></circle>
                <path d="M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11"></path>
              </svg>
              <span>Gold Medalist</span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="timeline-desc">
            <span class="lang-id">
              Meraih peringkat pertama pada seleksi tingkat kabupaten dan mewakili Purworejo di ajang <strong>LKS SMK Tingkat Provinsi Jawa Tengah ke-XXXIV</strong>. Menguasai modul konfigurasi Router Cisco, switching VLAN, manajemen jaringan MikroTik, dan setup server Debian/Windows dalam batasan waktu kompetisi ketat.
            </span>
            <span class="lang-en">
              Awarded 1st place in the regency selection and represented Purworejo at the <strong>34th Central Java Provincial Vocational Skills Competition (LKS)</strong>. Successfully completed timed modules in Cisco router configuration, VLAN switching, MikroTik administration, and Debian/Windows server deployment.
            </span>
          </p>
          <div class="timeline-tags">
            <span class="timeline-tag">Cisco IOS</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">MikroTik RouterOS</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">Debian 12</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">Windows Server</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 2: PERISAI Temon Projects (Juli 2026) -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-card timeline-card">
          <div class="timeline-card-header">
            <div>
              <span class="timeline-period font-mono">
                <span class="lang-id">Juli 2026</span>
                <span class="lang-en">July 2026</span>
              </span>
              <h3 class="timeline-role">
                <span class="lang-id">Lead Developer — Platform PERISAI & PERISAI AYOM</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Lead Developer — PERISAI & PERISAI AYOM Platforms</span>
              </h3>
              <span class="timeline-org">
                <span class="lang-id">Pemerintah Kapanewon Temon, Kulon Progo</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Kapanewon Temon Government, Kulon Progo</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="timeline-desc">
            <span class="lang-id">
              Merancang dan mengimplementasikan sistem pengaduan publik terpadu dan pelaporan perlindungan perempuan & anak. Mengintegrasikan <strong>Google Gemini 2.0 Flash</strong> untuk auto-triage laporan dalam 1–3 detik, notifikasi email resi, pemetaan GIS 15 Kalurahan, dan Row Level Security (RLS) PostgreSQL.
            </span>
            <span class="lang-en">
              Architected and deployed integrated public complaint and anonymous reporting platforms. Integrated <strong>Google Gemini 2.0 Flash</strong> for 1–3 second auto-triage, instant email dispatch, 15-village GIS mapping, and Supabase PostgreSQL Row Level Security (RLS).
            </span>
          </p>
          <div class="timeline-tags">
            <span class="timeline-tag">Next.js 16</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">Google Gemini AI</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">Supabase PostgreSQL</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">Leaflet GIS</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 3: PKL UPTD BLK Kebumen (Nov 2025 — Des 2025) -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-card timeline-card">
          <div class="timeline-card-header">
            <div>
              <span class="timeline-badge font-mono">Network & Server</span>
              <span class="timeline-period font-mono">
                <span class="lang-id">Nov 2025 — Des 2025</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Nov 2025 — Dec 2025</span>
              </span>
              <h3 class="timeline-role">
                <span class="lang-id">Peserta Praktik Kerja Lapangan (Network & Server)</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Internship Participant (Network & Server)</span>
              </h3>
              <span class="timeline-org">UPTD Balai Latihan Kerja (BLK) Kebumen</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="timeline-bullets">
            <li>
              <span class="lang-id">Konfigurasi jaringan LAN, WLAN, dan Hotspot menggunakan MikroTik RouterOS.</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Configured LAN, WLAN, and Hotspot networks using MikroTik RouterOS.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="lang-id">Implementasi static routing menggunakan Cisco Packet Tracer.</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Implemented static routing using Cisco Packet Tracer.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="lang-id">Instalasi Debian 12 pada VMware dan konfigurasi web server lokal (Nginx).</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Installed Debian 12 on VMware and configured local web servers (Nginx).</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="lang-id">Implementasi firewall MikroTik serta deployment CMS PrestaShop pada server lokal.</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Implemented MikroTik firewall rules and deployed PrestaShop CMS on local server.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="timeline-tags">
            <span class="timeline-tag">MikroTik RouterOS</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">Debian 12</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">Cisco PT</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">Nginx Web Server</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 4: PKL Fazza Computer (Sep 2025 — Nov 2025) -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-4">
        <div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-card timeline-card">
          <div class="timeline-card-header">
            <div>
              <span class="timeline-badge font-mono">FTTH & ISP Network</span>
              <span class="timeline-period font-mono">
                <span class="lang-id">Sep 2025 — Nov 2025</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Sep 2025 — Nov 2025</span>
              </span>
              <h3 class="timeline-role">
                <span class="lang-id">Peserta Praktik Kerja Lapangan (FTTH & Network)</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Internship Participant (FTTH & Network)</span>
              </h3>
              <span class="timeline-org">Fazza Computer</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="timeline-bullets">
            <li>
              <span class="lang-id">Instalasi jaringan Fiber To The Home (FTTH) untuk pelanggan baru.</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Installed Fiber To The Home (FTTH) network connections for new subscribers.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="lang-id">Konfigurasi dasar dan pengujian perangkat Optical Network Terminal (ONT).</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Performed baseline configuration and testing of Optical Network Terminal (ONT) devices.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="lang-id">Troubleshooting dasar dan pemeliharaan perangkat jaringan pelanggan.</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Troubleshot and maintained customer-premises network equipment and cabling.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="timeline-tags">
            <span class="timeline-tag">FTTH Fiber Optic</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">ONT Configuration</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">Network Troubleshooting</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 5: PKL IMC Computer (Feb 2025 — Apr 2025) -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-4">
        <div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-line hidden-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-card timeline-card">
          <div class="timeline-card-header">
            <div>
              <span class="timeline-badge font-mono">PC & Network Hardware</span>
              <span class="timeline-period font-mono">
                <span class="lang-id">Feb 2025 — Apr 2025</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Feb 2025 — Apr 2025</span>
              </span>
              <h3 class="timeline-role">
                <span class="lang-id">Peserta Praktik Kerja Lapangan (PC & Network)</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Internship Participant (PC & Network)</span>
              </h3>
              <span class="timeline-org">IMC Computer (Izzan Mediatek Computindo)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="timeline-bullets">
            <li>
              <span class="lang-id">Instalasi sistem operasi Windows pada komputer dan laptop.</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Installed Windows operating systems on desktops and laptops.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="lang-id">Perakitan komputer serta pemeriksaan fungsi hardware dan software.</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Assembled custom computers and verified hardware/software functionality.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="lang-id">Troubleshooting dasar dan pemeliharaan perangkat komputer.</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Handled computer troubleshooting, component maintenance, and diagnostics.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="timeline-tags">
            <span class="timeline-tag">PC Assembly</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">Windows OS Installation</span>
            <span class="timeline-tag">Hardware Diagnostics</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .experience-section {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .timeline-container {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: clamp(14px, 3vw, 24px);
  }

  .timeline-dot-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    width: 24px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .timeline-dot {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    border: 3px solid var(--bg-main);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-border);
    margin-top: 24px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .timeline-dot.gold {
    background: #EAB308;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.3);
  }

  .timeline-line {
    width: 2px;
    flex: 1;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin: 6px 0;
  }

  .hidden-line {
    display: none;
  }

  .timeline-card {
    flex: 1;
    padding: clamp(18px, 3vw, 26px);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .highlight-border {
    border-color: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.4);
  }

  .timeline-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .timeline-period {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .timeline-role {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .timeline-org {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-subtle);
    display: block;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .award-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.12);
    color: #CA8A04;
    border: 1px solid rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.3);
  }

  .timeline-badge {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .timeline-desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .timeline-desc strong {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .timeline-bullets {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 12px 0 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .timeline-bullets li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  .timeline-bullets li::before {
    content: '▹';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .timeline-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .timeline-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    color: var(--color-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
</style>
